<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIAN CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR AUG 14/15.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIAN CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR AUG 14/15.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Thursday</p>
<p>set the following currency fixings for August 15. The litas is</p>
<p>pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   15.08.97	  14.08.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.3326	    6.3394</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.1766	    2.1593</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.2772	    4.2462</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4400	    3.4357</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5003	    0.4996</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7263	    0.7211</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2723	    0.2699</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8370	    6.8277</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6885	    0.6888</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.1494	    1.1436</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
